  "appeal_decision": null,
  "description": "We propose the removal of a designated section of the existing floor structure to accommodate the installation of a high-security, large-capacity safe. This modification is necessary due to the safe’s dimensions, weight, and installation requirements, which exceed the capacity of the current flooring system.\nThe scope of work will include structural assessment, controlled demolition of the affected area, reinforcement as needed, and integration of the safe into the building structure in compliance with all relevant building codes and safety standards. All work will be performed by qualified professionals under proper permits and supervision to ensure the integrity of the surrounding structure is maintained.\nThis installation is critical for secure asset storage and enhanced security operations, and every precaution will be taken to ensure minimal disruption and full restoration of surrounding areas upon completion.\n\nWe also propose the remove an existing window (on the rear elevation) to facilitate the installation of a new access door. The modification is being undertaken to improve accessibility and functionality within the space.\n\nThe proposed work will involve the careful removal of the existing window unit, modification of the surrounding structure as required, and the installation of a code-compliant access door. All alterations will be carried out in accordance with applicable building regulations and structural requirements. Necessary reinforcements and weatherproofing measures will be implemented to ensure the integrity and safety of the building envelope.\n\nThis change is intended to enhance access and usability while maintaining the architectural consistency of the property.",
